     "units": "ug/m^3",
     "shape": [
      "rcv_cells"
     ],
     "description": "Per-receptor concentration response from the pSO4 pathway: the layer-0 SR matrix contracted with the per-cell emissions. One contraction rather than the point document's three, because an area or line source reaches only emission layer 0."
    },
